  "2026-10-10T07:29:12.369Z",codex-sol,"Final corrected linked renewal run passes 6/6, zero failures/skips/cancellations. Shared hash-valid malformed links/manifests refuse both owners with exactly one actual open; successful kinds remain usable after a role mismatch, and denials precede all cached results. Source-only negative proof is the observed two-versus-one open assertion, followed by restored positive validation. All 72 healthy reachable objects still read/hash once; latest native corpus measurement is 134217728 blob/record bytes, 21104670 buffer growth and 16060416 peak RSS growth. Static gates remain strict: 53 files, 285 documented declarations and zero duplicate source lines/tokens. Only four production files differ from the root relay head; served-sync test bytes are unchanged, all prior 21 proofs retained. Freeze PM/source after release of this claim, regenerate changelog and selfhost bundle, then run the complete npm release gate at the final committed head. Full counters and final hashes will be returned in handoff; no closure, merge, publication, deployment or GitHub feedback is authorized."
