  "2026-10-10T08:15:34.663Z",codex-vcs-auth-investigator,"Validation: focused composition command passed 2/2; focused custom-runtime ignore command passed 2/2, both also run through pm test --only-last --progress. Inline node --input-type=module disposable CLI/grant/path/shared-owner reproduction and live-lease configureAuthority reproduction both exited 0; temporary fixtures removed. No source/test/docs edits and no broad gate. Remaining risks: restricted caller threat model, lower-level helper lease ownership, strict recognized legacy migration and active custom tracker context need implementation/regression coverage. Release remains unclosed; orchestrator verifies and implements after handoff."
